   "source": [
    "# GitHub Issues Dataset\n",
    "### EDA, Data Cleaning & Feature Engineering"
   ],
   "id": "2773b4e9819553ed"
  },
  {
   "metadata": {},
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": "This dataset is an adaptation of the original [found on Kaggle](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/tobiasbueck/helpdesk-github-tickets/data) that removes PII from the data prior to processing and model training. User IDs and username columns have been removed entirely, and @ mentions of usernames have been replace with the generic '@user` text.",
   "id": "8323d70254977530"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": "## Import and Setup",
   "id": "f962df4daa014845"
